Z||000002||DecadenceR||07-17-2001||02:08 PM||||If you look at the bottom of any page on the forum, there's a link to get the Image Poster. You download that. Then you use that to post any pictures. it's really easy. There are also directions when you download it.<BR>basically you browse your pc, when you get the pic you want, you double click it. Then you click post it on the PIP. It'll save it. Then you go to History. click on the name under the pic you want to post. it;ll display a URL at the bottom. Copy that, adn paste it where you want the pic to h\be. good luck.||||reg||1
